n~~~\r\n4.16.0\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CONFIGURATION\r\nXCP-NG 8.2\r\nAdvanced Zone\r\n\r\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\r\nOracle Linux 8.4 - Management server, MYSQL 8.0.26\r\nXCP-NG 8.2 - hypervisor\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\nUser from domain1 can't deploy VM in dedicated to domain1 pod.\r\n\r\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\r\n~~~\r\nCreate domain. Create user in this domain. Dedicate pod to this domain. Create Compute offering with ImplicitDedicationPlanner with strict policy and choose domain1.\r\n~~~\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\n~~~\r\nAll users from this domain can deploy VMs only in this Pod\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\n~~~\r\nUser from this domain can't deploy VM in dedicated pod. \r\n~~~\r\n","comments":50,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/5803/comments","created_at":"2021-12-23T08:27:49Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/5803/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/5803","id":1087489320,"labels":[{"color":"84b6eb","default":false,"description":"","id":37843366,"name":"type:enhancement","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzg0MzM2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/type:enhancement"},{"color":"951862","default":false,"description":"","id":2630836378,"name":"status:needs-functional-definition","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjMwODM2Mzc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/status:needs-functional-definition"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/5803/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":1302,"created_at":"2021-01-04T09:07:50Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2486961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DaanHoogland","id":2486961,"login":"DaanHoogland","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODY5NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland"},"html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/milestone/19","id":6265435,"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/19/labels","node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjI2NTQzNQ==","number":19,"open_issues":185,"state":"open","title":"unplanned","updated_at":"2026-09-24T11:01:33Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/19"},"node_id":"I_kwDOAJTq2M5A0cUo","number":5803,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/5803/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack","state":"open","title":"User from domain can't deploy VM in pod dedicated to that domain","type":{"color":"blue","created_at":"2024-01-25T09:11:09Z","description":"A request, idea, or new functionality","id":93574,"name":"Feature","node_id":"IT_kwDNuP_OAAFthg","updated_at":"2024-10-08T08:30:20Z"},"updated_at":"2026-08-12T02:13:53Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/5803","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42668237?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/edikevich","id":42668237,"login":"edikevich","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjY4MjM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edikevich"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"\u003c!--\r\nVerify first that your issue/request is not already reported on GitHub.\r\nAlso test if the latest release and main branch are affected too.\r\nAlways add information AFTER of these HTML comments, but no need to delete the comments.\r\n--\u003e\r\n\r\n##### ISSUE TYPE\r\n\u003c!-- Pick one below and delete the rest --\u003e\r\n * Feature Idea\r\n\r\n##### COMPONENT NAME\r\n\u003c!--\r\nCategorize the issue, e.g. API, VR, VPN, UI, etc.\r\n--\u003e\r\n~~~\r\nUI,API,Guest Network\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\r\n\u003c!--\r\nNew line separated list of affected versions, commit ID for issues on main branch.\r\n--\u003e\r\n\r\n~~~\r\nN/A\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CONFIGURATION\r\n\u003c!--\r\nInformation about the configuration if relevant, e.g. basic network, advanced networking, etc.  N/A otherwise\r\n--\u003e\r\n\r\n\r\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\r\n\u003c!--\r\nInformation about the environment if relevant, N/A otherwise\r\n--\u003e\r\n\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\n\u003c!-- Explain the problem/feature briefly --\u003e\r\n\r\nWhen a Guest Network was created, the port forward and load balancer features only allow to be configure with pre-existing VM in same Guest Network. Sometime user will deploy self managed virtual ip address to support their application such as keepalived, MetalLB..etc. Today, the user will add a secondary NIC to the one of VM instance and then use the assigned NIC ip address to treat the virtual ip setup. Most of the time, it is unavoidable to use this appoarch when LB pool health check limit to L4 port checking. \r\n\r\nI'm wondering if ACS can implement IPAM management abstract under guest network to allow user create IP entities which will able to include into port forwarding or Load balancer member.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\r\n\u003c!--\r\nFor bugs, show exactly how to reproduce the problem, using a minimal test-case. Use Screenshots if accurate.\r\n\r\nFor new features, show how the feature would be used.\r\n--\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- Paste example playbooks or commands between quotes below --\u003e\r\n~~~\r\nN/A\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- You can also paste gist.github.com links for larger files --\u003e\r\n\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\n\u003c!-- What did you expect to happen when running the steps above? --\u003e\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\n\u003c!-- What actually happened? --\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003c!-- Paste verbatim command output between quotes below --\u003e\r\n~~~\r\nN/A\r\n~~~\r\n","comments":5,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6163/comments","created_at":"2022-03-25T08:20:22Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6163/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6163","id":1180482852,"labels":[{"color":"f9d0c4","default":false,"description":"","id":592559219,"name":"component:networking","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1OTI1NTkyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:networking"},{"color":"4471c4","default":false,"description":"","id":1150675549,"name":"type:new-feature","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTUwNjc1NTQ5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/type:new-feature"},{"color":"951862","default":false,"descrip