ium"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi,\r\n\r\nIf I configure the Prometheus exporter to allow requests from ::1 (ipv6 localhost, short form) it doesn't actually honour requests.\r\n\r\nIn the logs you can see entries such as:\r\n```Prometheus exporter received client request from: 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1```\r\n\r\nIndeed, once you add 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1 (ipv6 localhost, medium form) it starts working.\r\n\r\nIt's a minor issue, but nice to get sorted as most people are used to ::1.","comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714/comments","created_at":"2022-09-07T15:18:25Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714","id":1364832398,"labels":[{"color":"fc2929","default":false,"description":"","id":37843364,"name":"type:bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzg0MzM2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/type:bug"},{"color":"e08888","default":false,"description":"","id":1391967979,"name":"Severity:Trivial","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzkxOTY3OTc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/Severity:Trivial"},{"color":"C744C9","default":false,"description":"","id":4507982790,"name":"ipv6","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABDLJbxg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/ipv6"},{"color":"E265FC","default":false,"description":"","id":5651870091,"name":"component:prometheus","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABUOCxiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:prometheus"},{"color":"E43179","default":false,"description":"","id":6890295339,"name":"status:stale","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABmrGQKw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/status:stale"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":116,"created_at":"2026-04-13T07:02:43Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12028987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sureshanaparti","id":12028987,"login":"sureshanaparti","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDI4OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti"},"description":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/milestone/46","id":15514689,"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/46/labels","node_id":"MI_kwDOAJTq2M4A7LxB","number":46,"open_issues":264,"state":"open","title":"4.22.2","updated_at":"2026-10-01T15:03:42Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/46"},"node_id":"I_kwDOAJTq2M5RWbCO","number":6714,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack","state":"open","title":"Prometheus exporter - interpret ::1 as 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1","updated_at":"2026-06-29T08:38:57Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2357012?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NuxRo","id":2357012,"login":"NuxRo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTcwMTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"##### ISSUE TYPE\r\n * Bug Report\r\n\r\n##### COMPONENT NAME\r\n~~~\r\nManagement, Network, SystemVM\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\r\n~~~\r\n4.16.1\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CONFIGURATION\r\nIn database:\r\n```\r\nMariaDB [cloud]\u003e select name,value from configuration where name = 'control.cidr';\r\n+--------------+------------------+\r\n| name         | value            |\r\n+--------------+------------------+\r\n| control.cidr | 169.254.240.0/20 |\r\n+--------------+------------------+\r\nMariaDB [cloud]\u003e select name,value from configuration where name = 'control.gateway';\r\n+-----------------+---------------+\r\n| name            | value         |\r\n+-----------------+---------------+\r\n| control.gateway | 169.254.240.1 |\r\n+-----------------+---------------+\r\nMariaDB [cloud]\u003e select count(*) from op_dc_link_local_ip_address_alloc;\r\n+----------+\r\n| count(*) |\r\n+----------+\r\n|    65533 |\r\n+----------+\r\n```\r\nOn agent:\r\n```\r\nroot@hv-04-02-21:~# grep control.cidr /etc/cloudstack/agent/agent.properties\r\ncontrol.cidr=169.254.240.0/20\r\n```\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\nWhen having set a `control.cidr` different from the norm (`168.254.0.0/16`) and the database table `op_dc_link_local_ip_address_alloc` is already populated with all the addresses in the default CIDR, then allocating an IP to a System VM does not take into account the requested CIDR, thus allocating an IP address in the wrong range.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/apache/cloudstack/blob/main/engine/schema/src/main/java/com/cloud/dc/dao/DataCenterLinkLocalIpAddressDaoImpl.java#L52 should take this into account. This function is called in https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/blob/main/server/src/main/java/com/cloud/network/guru/ControlNetworkGuru.java#L134\r\n\r\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\r\n- Install new management server\r\n- After kickstart, disable the zone to prevent any system vm deploys\r\n- In mysql database: `select count(*) from op_dc_link_local_ip_address_alloc;`, it would return `65533`\r\n- Connect agents\r\n- Configure `control.cidr` on the manager and agents, and `control.gateway` on the manager, ie:\r\n```\r\ncontrol.cidr=169.254.240.0/20\r\ncontrol.gateway=169.254.240.1\r\n```\r\n- Enable the zone, check the system vm link local address\r\n\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\n- The System VMs should receive an IP address in the configured CIDR.\r\n- Additional expected: In mysql database: `select count(*) from op_dc_link_local_ip_address_alloc;`, it should return `4093`\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\n- System VMs receive an IP address in the default `169.254.0.0/16` range\r\n```\r\n2022-09-07 22:45:35,338 DEBUG [o.a.c.e.o.NetworkOrchestrator] (Work-Job-Executor-3:ctx-b1c76634 job-149/job-150 ctx-224681ec) (logid:32608415) Network id=201 is already implemented\r\n2022-09-07 22:45:35,524 DEBUG [c.c.n.g.ControlNetworkGuru] (Work-Job-Executor-3:ctx-b1c76634 job-149/job-150 ctx-224681ec) (logid:32608415) Reserved NIC for v-18-VM [ipv4:169.254.167.69 netmask:255.255.240.0 gateway:169.254.240.1]\r\n```\r\n","comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6715/comments","created_at":"2022-09-08T08:18:52Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6715/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6715","id":1365767365,"labels":[{"color":"006b75","default":false,"description":"","id":584072971,"name":"component:kvm","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODQwNzI5NzE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:kvm"},{"color":"f9d0c4","default":false,"description":"","id":592559219,"name":"component:networking","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1OTI1NTkyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:networking"},{"color":"906666","default":false,"description":"","id":1391968610,"name":"Severity:Minor","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzkxOTY4NjEw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/Severity:Minor"},{"color":"906C28","default":false,"description":"","id":2694797573,"name":"status:needs-investigation","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjk0Nzk3NTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/status:needs-investigation"},{"color":"E43179","default":false,"description":"","id":6890295339,"name":"status:stale","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABmrGQKw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/status:stale"},{"color":"ededed","default":false,"id":9849008471,"name":"no-issue-activity","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAACSwvxVw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/no-issue-activity"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6715/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":1302,"created_at":"2021-01-04T09:07:50Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2486961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DaanHoogland","id":2486961,"login":"Daa