[2026-10-02T13:37:00.763Z] [DEBUG] [rpc] github←resp 1590b {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"number\":5803,\"title\":\"User from domain can\\u0026#39;t deploy VM in pod dedicated to that domain\",\"body\":\"##### ISSUE TYPE\\n * Bug Report\\n\\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\\n~~~\\n4.16.0\\n~~~\\n\\n##### CONFIGURATION\\nXCP-NG 8.2\\nAdvanced Zone\\n\\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\\nOracle Linux 8.4 - Management server, MYSQL 8.0.26\\nXCP-NG 8.2 - hypervisor\\n\\n##### SUMMARY\\nUser from domain1 can\\u0026#39;t deploy VM in dedicated to domain1 pod.\\n\\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\\n~~~\\nCreate domain. Create user in this domain. Dedicate pod to this domain. Create Compute offering with ImplicitDedicationPlanner with strict policy and choose domain1.\\n~~~\\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\\n~~~\\nAll users from this domain can deploy VMs only in this Pod\\n~~~\\n\\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\\n~~~\\nUser from this domain can\\u0026#39;t deploy VM in dedicated pod. \\n~~~\\n\",\"state\":\"open\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/5803\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"edikevich\",\"id\":42668237,\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/edikevich\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42668237?v=4\"},\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"labels\":[\"type:enhancement\",\"status:needs-functional-definition\"],\"milestone\":\"unplanned\",\"comments\":50,\"reactions\":{\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"created_at\":\"2021-12-23T08:27:49Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T02:13:53Z\",\"issue_type\":\"Feature\"}"}]}}
