[2026-10-02T13:37:04.468Z] [DEBUG] [rpc] github←resp 1722b {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"number\":6718,\"title\":\"conntrackd filling up var\",\"body\":\"##### ISSUE TYPE\\n * Bug Report\\n\\n##### COMPONENT NAME\\n~~~\\nVR\\n~~~\\n\\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\\n~~~\\nlatest\\n~~~\\n\\n##### CONFIGURATION\\n~~~\\nN/A\\n~~~\\n\\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\\n~~~\\nKVM\\n~~~\\n\\n##### SUMMARY\\n~~~\\nWe have large customers with a lot of VR traffic traversing the VRs.  Logrotate cannot keep up and /var fills up to 100%, causing the VR to exhibit problems when attempting to start/restart instances in the VPC and/or traffic stops flowing.  Conntrackd is logging verbosely to daemon.log.\\n~~~\\n\\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\\n~~~\\n\\n1. Construct a VPC with a redundant VR pair with a private gateway or tunnel\\n2. Create a large amount of traffic to/from a VPC over gateway or tunnel\\n\\n~~~\\n\\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\\n~~~\\n/var should not fill up regardless of traffic load\\n~~~\\n\\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\\n~~~\\n/var fills up\\n~~~\",\"state\":\"open\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6718\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"ghost\",\"id\":10137,\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/ghost\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4\"},\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"labels\":[\"type:bug\",\"component:virtual-router\",\"component:logging\",\"Severity:Minor\",\"status:needs-investigation\",\"status:stale\",\"no-issue-activity\"],\"milestone\":\"unplanned\",\"comments\":3,\"reactions\":{\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"created_at\":\"2022-09-08T22:58:16Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-27T02:18:45Z\"}"}]}}
